#scene: chiefs office

picture chief_office_harlowe_return.jpg

Boffin: We've just recieved reports that Harlow has dispatched the ape, rescued the blonde, obtained her phone number and is now returning to base.

Chief: We're all lucky that crazy screwup didn't cause more damage. Giving that maniac a plane is like giving a monkey a machine gun.

Mayor: You can't deny that he is a talented pilot. 

Boffin: And a hit with the ladies!

Chief: Perhaps. Do you know why he was sent to that joke of a posting? The higher-ups created it to put him there and forget about him. His behavior was always a concern, his constant drinking before, during and after work.... but for years they looked the other way since he could fly with the best of them.

Mayor: What did he do to rub the top brass in the wrong way? Some sort of crash, wasn't it?

Chief: He was one of the army's top pilots with scores of successful missions under his belt and a promising military career in front of him.

Chief: So harlow, go rescue a blonde somehow

